This project contains TypeScript ports of manga source extensions from
keiyoushi/extensions-source (https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source),
and of anime source extensions and their libraries from yuzono/anime-extensions
(https://github.com/yuzono/anime-extensions), both licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes from the original work:
- Kotlin source files are translated to TypeScript, one port per upstream
  extension, under src/<lang>/<name>/. Each port names its upstream file in a
  header comment.
- The Mihon/Keiyoushi runtime APIs they call (KeiSource, Jsoup, OkHttp helpers)
  are reimplemented in sdk/ on top of cheerio and the host application's fetch;
  Aniyomi's AnimeHttpSource (lib 16) is reimplemented in sdk/anime.ts, and the
  video extractors the anime ports use in libs/.
- Only English and Indonesian sources are ported.
